## Why This Is Asked
Real-time ingestion requires per-user ordering with horizontal scaling and partition tolerance. This probes dispatch strategy, backpressure semantics, and handling late events.

## Key Concepts
- Per-user FIFO queues
- Distributed dispatcher
- Bounded queues and backpressure
- Late-event reordering window
- Idempotent downstream writes

## Code Example
